  "description": "Zero-downtime, memory-mapped cache for .NET.\n\t\t\tStores data in off-heap mmap shard files with a FasterKV index.\n\t\t\tSupports TTL-based background reload, atomic version swap,\n\t\t\tand warm restart (resumes from disk without hitting the data source).",
